/20011220005645/http://forg.co.kr:80/Diablo/uthrowing.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>던지는 \n                무기</b></font></a><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b> |</b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/uwands/\"><b><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"> </font></b><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>완드</b></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><b><font color=\"#996600\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Elite \nUniques</font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"> </font></b><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>: </b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/euweapons/\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>무기</b></font></a><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b> | </b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/euarmor/\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>아머</b></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolordark=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolorlight=\"#CCCCCC\" cellpadding=\"7\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"580\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#F8F8F8\" colspan=\"3\" height=\"30\" width=\"562\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20011220005645/http://forg.co.kr:80/Diablo/sets7.shtml#sandersfolly\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>&nbsp;</b></font></a><font color=\"#CC9900\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><b>Unique Rings</b></font><font color=\"#999900\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><b> </b></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>[반지]</b></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"black\" width=\"86\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><img height=\"33\" src=\"/img/posts/site/Diablo/images/item/unique/ring1.gif\" width=\"32\">\n</span></font></p><center>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><font color=\"#908858\"><span><b>Nagelring</b></span></font></span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"white\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\">Ring</font><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><br></span></font></p></center></td>\n<td bgcolor=\"white\" width=\"213\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>Required Level: 7<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Magic Damage Reduced By 3</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+50-75 To \nAttack Rating</font>(varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Attacker Takes Damage of \n3</font>*<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">15-30% Better Chance Of Getting Magic \nItem</font>(varies)<br>(Only Spawns In Patch 1.09 or later) </span></font> </p></td>\n<td width=\"231\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>레벨 \n                            요구치 : 7<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">매직데미지 감소 3</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+50-75 공격등급 </font>(varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">공격자가 받는 데미지 3</font>*<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">15-30% 매직아이템 얻을 확률증가</font>(varies)<br>(1.09 패치이후부터 \n                            얻을 수 있음)</span></font> </p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"black\" width=\"86\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><img height=\"33\" src=\"/img/posts/site/Diablo/images/item/unique/ring2.gif\" width=\"32\">\n</span></font></p><center>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><font color=\"#908858\"><span><b>Manald \nHeal</b></span></font></span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"white\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><span>Ring</span></span></font></p></center></td>\n<td bgcolor=\"white\" width=\"213\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>Required Level: 15<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">4-7% Mana Stolen Per Hit</font>(varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Replenish Life +5-8</font>(varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Regenerate Mana 20%</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+20 To \nLife</font><br>(Only Spawns In Patch 1.09 or later) </span></font> </p></td>\n<td width=\"231\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>레벨 \n                            요구치 : 15<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">4공격명중시 4-7% 마나 획득</font>(varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">라이프회복력 +5-8</font>(varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">마나재생력 20%</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+20 라이프</font><br>(Only Spawns In Patch 1.09 or later) </span></font> </p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"black\" width=\"86\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><img height=\"33\" src=\"/img/posts/site/Diablo/images/item/unique/ring3.gif\" width=\"32\">\n</span></font></p><center>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><font color=\"#908858\"><span><b>Stone of \nJordan</b></span></font></span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"white\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><span>Ring</span></span></font></p></center> </td>\n<td bgcolor=\"white\" width=\"213\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>Required Level: 29<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+1 To All Skill Levels</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Increase \nMaximum Mana 25%</font>*<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Adds 1-12 Lightning \nDamage</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+20 To Mana</font><br>(Spawns In Any Patch) \n</span></font> </p></td>\n<td width=\"231\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>레벨 \n                            요구치 : 29<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+1 모든스킬</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">최대 마나치 25%증가</font>*<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">1-12 라이트닝 데미지 추가</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+20 마나</font></span></font> </p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"black\" width=\"86\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><img height=\"33\" src=\"/img/posts/site/Diablo/images/item/unique/ring2.gif\" width=\"32\">\n</span></font></p><center>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><font color=\"#908858\"><span><b>Dwarf \nStar</b></span></font></span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"white\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><span>Ring</span></span></font></p></center></td>\n<td bgcolor=\"white\" width=\"213\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>Required Level: 45<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Fire Absorb 15%</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Heal Stamina Plus \n15%</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+40 Maximum Stamina</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+40 Life</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">100% Extra Gold From \nMonsters</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Magic Damage Reduced By \n12-15</font>(varies)<br>(Only Spawns In Patch 1.09 or later) </span></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"231\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; m